# Only needed when the website and the API are hosted on DIFFERENT addresses (for example Vercel + Render).
# Set it in the Vercel project settings (Environment Variables), then REDEPLOY: the value is baked in at build time.
# No trailing slash. Leave it unset when the backend serves the website itself, or when running locally (Vite proxies /api).
VITE_API_BASE=https://your-service.onrender.com
